# Every text file is LF in the repository AND in the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The hooks are bash scripts that break on CRLF, and new-project.sh copies these files into
# projects that normalise to LF; a CRLF checkout made every copied file show as modified there.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text
